[{"sha":"cbeb53ce4f17a06ea490ae43effcdad231143610","node_id":"C_kwDOUd_rotoAKGNiZWI1M2NlNGYxN2EwNmVhNDkwYWU0M2VmZmNkYWQyMzExNDM2MTA","commit":{"author":{"name":"Roman","email":"romanslack1@gmail.com","date":"2026-09-17T00:19:25Z"},"committer":{"name":"Roman","email":"romanslack1@gmail.com","date":"2026-09-17T00:19:25Z"},"message":"Flight control: clamp desired vertical accel, lateral position loop\n\nThree real bugs, in order of impact.\n\n1. A quadrotor cannot thrust downward. On a hard commanded descent a_z + G goes\n   negative, so b3 = a_des/|a_des| points at the floor and the controller commands\n   an inverted attitude. The aircraft flips, enters attitude recovery (which zeroes\n   horizontal accel) and drifts sideways with NO lateral control while the navigator\n   is still correctly calling for a dodge. Clamping a_des[2] positive was worth more\n   than every attitude-gain sweep combined.\n\n2. Lateral control was a velocity command held until the next judgment, so nothing\n   told the aircraft where to stop; it crossed the full corridor into the far wall.\n   Replaced with a position loop servoing to a target lateral offset that the steer\n   score selects.\n\n3. That position has to be estimated. The wall measurement disappears exactly when\n   it matters, and the naive fallback had the aircraft believing it was mid-tunnel\n   while pinned against a wall at y=+5.5. Complementary filter (integrate lateral\n   velocity, correct on plausible wall readings): 0.07 m median error vs truth.\n\nTunnel at 9 m/s: 55 m -> 124 m, max tilt now under 90 deg. Obstacle course\nbaseline unchanged and intact (crossed 0/3, 0 collisions, 0 crashes).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"30898886a6be2577a12e01410916eb23bc7b6f93","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RomanSlack/jev-drone/git/trees/30898886a6be2577a12e01410916eb23bc7b6f93"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RomanSlack/jev-drone/git/commits/cbeb53ce4f17a06ea490ae43effcdad231143610","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":false,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"payload":null,"verified_at":null}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RomanSlack/jev-drone/commits/cbeb53ce4f17a06ea490ae43effcdad231143610","html_url":"https://github.com/RomanSlack/jev-drone/commit/cbeb53ce4f17a06ea490ae43effcdad231143610","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RomanSlack/jev-drone/commits/cbeb53ce4f17a06ea490ae43effcdad231143610/comments","author":{"login":"RomanSlack","id":93448780,"node_id":"U_kgDOBZHqTA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/93448780?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RomanSlack","html_url":"https://github.com/RomanSlack","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RomanSlack/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RomanSlack/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RomanSlack/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RomanSlack/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RomanSlack/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RomanSlack/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RomanSlack/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RomanSlack/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RomanSlack/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"RomanSlack","id":93448780,"node_id":"U_kgDOBZHqTA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/93448780?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RomanSlack","html_url":"https://github.com/RomanSlack","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RomanSlack/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RomanSlack/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RomanSlack/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RomanSlack/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RomanSlack/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RomanSlack/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RomanSlack/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RomanSlack/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RomanSlack/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"961494d2d4fceaa861d769cbd5415ef9eff58d0a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RomanSlack/jev-drone/commits/961494d2d4fceaa861d769cbd5415ef9eff58d0a","html_url":"https://github.com/RomanSlack/jev-drone/commit/961494d2d4fceaa861d769cbd5415ef9eff58d0a"}]},{"sha":"961494d2d4fceaa861d769cbd5415ef9eff58d0a","node_id":"C_kwDOUd_rotoAKDk2MTQ5NGQyZDRmY2VhYTg2MWQ3NjljYmQ1NDE1ZWY5ZWZmNThkMGE","commit":{"author":{"name":"Roman","email":"romanslack1@gmail.com","date":"2026-09-16T23:40:39Z"},"committer":{"name":"Roman","email":"romanslack1@gmail.com","date":"2026-09-16T23:40:39Z"},"message":"Quaternion attitude control; tunnel chase with Jev as sole navigator\n\nThe geometric attitude controller could not recover from inverted flight by\nconstruction: eR = 0.5*vee(Rd^T R - R^T Rd) scales as sin(theta), peaking at\n90 deg and falling to ZERO at 180 deg, so an upside-down aircraft sits at a\nstationary point with no restoring torque. Replaced with a quaternion error\n(sin(theta/2), monotonic to 180 deg). Verified recovery from 179 deg. The\nobstacle course improved from 77 m to 88 m as a side effect.\n\nAlso here: a 620 m tunnel chase where Jev is the ONLY navigator (no reflex, no\nhand-written avoidance), driven by two graded Score questions whose levels map\nstraight onto the control command. Pipelined workers sustain 21 decisions/s at\n0.118 s latency with zero errors. Measured reaction budget says the model is 13%\nof the loop and the airframe is 80%.\n\nPerception fixes: sight range 25 -> 45 m (a 25 m horizon is 1.7s at 15 m/s);\n3-frame median on depth (free space was flickering 3x between frames, so no\ndecision layer could commit); height = depth*sin(elev)/cos(elev-tilt) instead of\ndepth*tan(elev), which is wrong for a pitched camera; vertical free-space bands\nreplacing fragile edge-finding.\n\nTunnel is a partial result: stable and dodging cleanly in the best runs\n(0 collisions, 94% target visibility) but not reliably clearing the full length.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8f8b0de719b511faa91a4c1a43def1434e57a3e9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RomanSlack/jev-drone/git/trees/8f8b0de719b511faa91a4c1a43def1434e57a3e9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RomanSlack/jev-drone/git/commits/961494d2d4fceaa861d769cbd5415ef9eff58d0a","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":false,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"payload":null,"verified_at":null}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RomanSlack/jev-drone/commits/961494d2d4fceaa861d769cbd5415ef9eff58d0a","html_url":"https://github.com/RomanSlack/jev-drone/commit/961494d2d4fceaa861d769cbd5415ef9eff58d0a","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RomanSlack/jev-drone/commits/961494d2d4fceaa861d769cbd5415ef9eff58d0a/comments","author":{"login":"RomanSlack","id":93448780,"node_id":"U_kgDOBZHqTA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/93448780?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RomanSlack","html_url":"https://github.com/RomanSlack","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RomanSlack/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RomanSlack/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RomanSlack/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RomanSlack/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RomanSlack/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RomanSlack/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RomanSlack/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RomanSlack/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RomanSlack/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"RomanSlack","id":93448780,"node_id":"U_kgDOBZHqTA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/93448780?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RomanSlack","html_url":"https://github.com/RomanSlack","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RomanSlack/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RomanSlack/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RomanSlack/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RomanSlack/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RomanSlack/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RomanSlack/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RomanSlack/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RomanSlack/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RomanSlack/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"096bb795a61d96cb53d978758ae8a90cf8c35164","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RomanSlack/jev-drone/commits/096bb795a61d96cb53d978758ae8a90cf8c35164","html_url":"https://github.com/RomanSlack/jev-drone/commit/096bb795a61d96cb53d978758ae8a90cf8c35164"}]},{"sha":"096bb795a61d96cb53d978758ae8a90cf8c35164","node_id":"C_kwDOUd_rotoAKDA5NmJiNzk1YTYxZDk2Y2I1M2Q5Nzg3NThhZThhOTBjZjhjMzUxNjQ","commit":{"author":{"name":"Roman","email":"romanslack1@gmail.com","date":"2026-09-16T21:14:19Z"},"committer":{"name":"Roman","email":"romanslack1@gmail.com","date":"2026-09-16T21:14:19Z"},"message":"Target memory: estimate where the rover went instead of sweeping blindly\n\nA camera bearing is useless once the target leaves frame. The drone was\nsweeping around a stale heading and sitting still while the rover drove off.\nNow it converts bearing + range + own pose into a world-frame position, carries\nit forward with the observed velocity, and flies there. Validated against\nground truth: 0.14 m position error, 0.12 m/s velocity error.\n\nThe velocity has to be differentiated over ~1s; over a single 0.07s camera\nframe, pixel noise becomes tens of m/s and the drone extrapolates itself 100 m\noff course.\n\nWhole course now: 77.5 m, target in view 82% of the time, zero collisions,\nincluding losing the rover in the cluster and re-acquiring it.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"99fe39a25d1547887aa0df318aaf9431600e9684","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RomanSlack/jev-drone/git/trees/99fe39a25d1547887aa0df318aaf9431600e9684"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RomanSlack/jev-drone/git/commits/096bb795a61d96cb53d978758ae8a90cf8c35164","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":false,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"payload":null,"verified_at":null}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RomanSlack/jev-drone/commits/096bb795a61d96cb53d978758ae8a90cf8c35164","html_url":"https://github.com/RomanSlack/jev-drone/commit/096bb795a61d96cb53d978758ae8a90cf8c35164","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RomanSlack/jev-drone/commits/096bb795a61d96cb53d978758ae8a90cf8c35164/comments","author":{"login":"RomanSlack","id":93448780,"node_id":"U_kgDOBZHqTA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/93448780?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RomanSlack","html_url":"https://github.com/RomanSlack","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RomanSlack/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RomanSlack/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RomanSlack/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RomanSlack/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RomanSlack/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RomanSlack/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RomanSlack/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RomanSlack/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RomanSlack/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"RomanSlack","id":93448780,"node_id":"U_kgDOBZHqTA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/93448780?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RomanSlack","html_url":"https://github.com/RomanSlack","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RomanSlack/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RomanSlack/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RomanSlack/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RomanSlack/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RomanSlack/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RomanSlack/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RomanSlack/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RomanSlack/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RomanSlack/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"8faccf8ff97ed69ec977632b5071fd0ca89cc182","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RomanSlack/jev-drone/commits/8faccf8ff97ed69ec977632b5071fd0ca89cc182","html_url":"https://github.com/RomanSlack/jev-drone/commit/8faccf8ff97ed69ec977632b5071fd0ca89cc182"}]},{"sha":"8faccf8ff97ed69ec977632b5071fd0ca89cc182","node_id":"C_kwDOUd_rotoAKDhmYWNjZjhmZjk3ZWQ2OWVjOTc3NjMyYjUwNzFmZDBjYTg5Y2MxODI","commit":{"author":{"name":"Roman","email":"romanslack1@gmail.com","date":"2026-09-16T21:04:22Z"},"committer":{"name":"Roman","email":"romanslack1@gmail.com","date":"2026-09-16T21:04:22Z"},"message":"Ignore scratch frames at repo root\n\nOnly docs/ images belong in the repo.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d5c4972124d9bde80f8685d2e7919dd3a18027dd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RomanSlack/jev-drone/git/trees/d5c4972124d9bde80f8685d2e7919dd3a18027dd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RomanSlack/jev-drone/git/commits/8faccf8ff97ed69ec977632b5071fd0ca89cc182","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":false,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"payload":null,"verified_at":null}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RomanSlack/jev-drone/commits/8faccf8ff97ed69ec977632b5071fd0ca89cc182","html_url":"https://github.com/RomanSlack/jev-drone/commit/8faccf8ff97ed69ec977632b5071fd0ca89cc182","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RomanSlack/jev-drone/commits/8faccf8ff97ed69ec977632b5071fd0ca89cc182/comments","author":{"login":"RomanSlack","id":93448780,"node_id":"U_kgDOBZHqTA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/93448780?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RomanSlack","html_url":"https://github.com/RomanSlack","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RomanSlack/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RomanSlack/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RomanSlack/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RomanSlack/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RomanSlack/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RomanSlack/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RomanSlack/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RomanSlack/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RomanSlack/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"RomanSlack","id":93448780,"node_id":"U_kgDOBZHqTA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/93448780?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RomanSlack","html_url":"https://github.com/RomanSlack","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RomanSlack/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RomanSlack/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RomanSlack/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RomanSlack/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RomanSlack/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RomanSlack/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RomanSlack/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RomanSlack/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RomanSlack/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"0ecc4f238929a564cf513c8b5109e4393e8fe386","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RomanSlack/jev-drone/commits/0ecc4f238929a564cf513c8b5109e4393e8fe386","html_url":"https://github.com/RomanSlack/jev-drone/commit/0ecc4f238929a564cf513c8b5109e4393e8fe386"}]},{"sha":"0ecc4f238929a564cf513c8b5109e4393e8fe386","node_id":"C_kwDOUd_rotoAKDBlY2M0ZjIzODkyOWE1NjRjZjUxM2M4YjUxMDllNDM5M2U4ZmUzODY","commit":{"author":{"name":"Roman","email":"romanslack1@gmail.com","date":"2026-09-16T21:04:04Z"},"committer":{"name":"Roman","email":"romanslack1@gmail.com","date":"2026-09-16T21:04:04Z"},"message":"Faster flight, path-ahead reflex: drone completes all five stations\n\nThe reflex braked on the nearest obstacle anywhere in the forward cone, so\nwalls beside the aircraft triggered it. Any gap narrower than twice the reflex\nradius was impossible to enter: the sliding gate was not hard, it was forbidden.\nBrake on what is in the path instead.\n\nWith that fixed and the airframe flown harder (3.6 m/s), the full course goes in\n~41s: climb both beams, time the turnstiles, thread the sliding gap, cross the\ncluster. The baseline still stops dead at station 2.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"93aff92e991cd111f479ef7e11482db9fe611110","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RomanSlack/jev-drone/git/trees/93aff92e991cd111f479ef7e11482db9fe611110"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RomanSlack/jev-drone/git/commits/0ecc4f238929a564cf513c8b5109e4393e8fe386","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":false,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"payload":null,"verified_at":null}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RomanSlack/jev-drone/commits/0ecc4f238929a564cf513c8b5109e4393e8fe386","html_url":"https://github.com/RomanSlack/jev-drone/commit/0ecc4f238929a564cf513c8b5109e4393e8fe386","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RomanSlack/jev-drone/commits/0ecc4f238929a564cf513c8b5109e4393e8fe386/comments","author":{"login":"RomanSlack","id":93448780,"node_id":"U_kgDOBZHqTA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/93448780?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RomanSlack","html_url":"https://github.com/RomanSlack","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RomanSlack/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RomanSlack/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RomanSlack/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RomanSlack/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RomanSlack/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RomanSlack/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RomanSlack/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RomanSlack/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RomanSlack/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"RomanSlack","id":93448780,"node_id":"U_kgDOBZHqTA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/93448780?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RomanSlack","html_url":"https://github.com/RomanSlack","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RomanSlack/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RomanSlack/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RomanSlack/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RomanSlack/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RomanSlack/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RomanSlack/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RomanSlack/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RomanSlack/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RomanSlack/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"573271b00b78afe9f20994676f4c7eaaadcc8eb0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RomanSlack/jev-drone/commits/573271b00b78afe9f20994676f4c7eaaadcc8eb0","html_url":"https://github.com/RomanSlack/jev-drone/commit/573271b00b78afe9f20994676f4c7eaaadcc8eb0"}]},{"sha":"573271b00b78afe9f20994676f4c7eaaadcc8eb0","node_id":"C_kwDOUd_rotoAKDU3MzI3MWIwMGI3OGFmZTlmMjA5OTQ2NzZmNGM3ZWFhYWRjYzhlYjA","commit":{"author":{"name":"Roman","email":"romanslack1@gmail.com","date":"2026-09-16T20:54:02Z"},"committer":{"name":"Roman","email":"romanslack1@gmail.com","date":"2026-09-16T20:54:02Z"},"message":"Camera-only autonomous drone with a judgment model in the loop\n\nA Skydio X2 flies a five-station obstacle course in MuJoCo using only its\nonboard camera. Classical CV turns depth + segmentation into a compact\nsymbolic scene; TypeSafe's Jev answers three typed questions about it at\n~2.5 Hz (Choice/Score/Noul). Code owns geometry, control and the safety\nreflex, and keeps a veto over every judgment.\n\nThe ablation is the same stack with the model disabled: it is safe but\nstructurally stuck at the full-width beam, because \"go over it\" is not a\nmaneuver the greedy heuristic can express.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"545199da0087dcdae963aae06c88af155f48e820","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RomanSlack/jev-drone/git/trees/545199da0087dcdae963aae06c88af155f48e820"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RomanSlack/jev-